From 0ae63a361e95a60ce6ff43a241667ae3de9243cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 04:44:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add alias name to field-added dealers, shown in brackets next
 to shop name
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Reps often know a shop by "owner surname + area" (e.g. "Sharma
Shahdra", "Verma Bhajanpura") rather than its exact signboard name —
also exactly what disambiguates two different shops both typed in as
"Sharma Electric". Adds an optional Alias field to both "+ Add New
Dealer" forms (Dashboard and Check-In tab), shown as "Shop Name (Alias)"
wherever a field-added dealer is listed (dealer lists, admin's
submissions queue), and included in the rep's own dealer search.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GxWPdEf21EL6SvRpGBbX8q
